{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 2, "text": "神发怒，发洪水淹没了人类。在这些传说中，德俊还仅仅是神话中的人物，算不上严格的", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 274, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神发怒，发洪水淹没了人类。在这些传说中，德俊还仅仅是神话中的人物，算不上严格的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 274, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 3, "text": "宗教意义上的崇拜对象。但在镇宁一带的《古谢经•韦氏擒雕经节》中，德俊（德金）已变", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 346, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "宗教意义上的崇拜对象。但在镇宁一带的《古谢经•韦氏擒雕经节》中，德俊（德金）已变", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 346, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 4, "text": "成韦氏的英雄始祖神，在韦氏迁徙途中帮助众人打死了吞食人类的巨雕。因而，受到韦", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 410, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "成韦氏的英雄始祖神，在韦氏迁徙途中帮助众人打死了吞食人类的巨雕。因而，受到韦", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 410, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 5, "text": "姓崇拜。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 471, "w": 149, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "姓崇拜。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 471, "w": 149, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 6, "text": "除上述神祇外，摩教信仰的还有干卡（kazn”ka'）、雅各冬、雅各迪、独仙、独拜等神祇。", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 535, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "除上述神祇外，摩教信仰的还有干卡（kazn”ka'）、雅各冬、雅各迪、独仙、独拜等神祇。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 535, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 7, "text": "对这些神，有的仅是信仰而已，而有的则被赋子了某种职能，成为人们崇拜的对象。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 603, "w": 1431, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "对这些神，有的仅是信仰而已，而有的则被赋子了某种职能，成为人们崇拜的对象。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 603, "w": 1431, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 8, "text": "（二）自然神灵系统", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 668, "w": 350, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）自然神灵系统", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 668, "w": 350, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 9, "text": "布依族信仰中的自然神灵系统很复杂，几乎每种自然现象和各种事物都有相应的神", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 728, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族信仰中的自然神灵系统很复杂，几乎每种自然现象和各种事物都有相应的神", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 728, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 10, "text": "灵。例如天神、雷神、月神、山神、河神、田神，等等；动植物也有相应的神灵，如牛王、树", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 797, "w": 1536, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "灵。例如天神、雷神、月神、山神、河神、田神，等等；动植物也有相应的神灵，如牛王、树", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 797, "w": 1536, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 11, "text": "神、谷神，等等；人工制造物也有神灵，如门神、灶神、圈神、梯子神，等等；还有一类可称之", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 861, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神、谷神，等等；人工制造物也有神灵，如门神、灶神、圈神、梯子神，等等；还有一类可称之", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 861, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 12, "text": "社会神，如寨神、家神、社神，等等；此外，还有专司人类各种疾病的相应神灵。这里择", "bbox_px": {"x": 136, "y": 921, "w": 1501, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "社会神，如寨神、家神、社神，等等；此外，还有专司人类各种疾病的相应神灵。这里择", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 136, "y": 921, "w": 1501, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 13, "text": "其要者加以介绍，以一斑窥全豹。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 990, "w": 575, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其要者加以介绍，以一斑窥全豹。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 990, "w": 575, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 14, "text": "1. 天神（tu^eian'）", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1050, "w": 326, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "1. 天神（tu^eian'）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1050, "w": 326, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 15, "text": "据说天神知晓宇宙万物的一切，注视着人类的一言一行，一举一动，代表公正和良", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1118, "w": 1455, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "据说天神知晓宇宙万物的一切，注视着人类的一言一行，一举一动，代表公正和良", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1118, "w": 1455, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 16, "text": "心，对人的言行进行监督和裁决，给以相应的报偿和惩罚。并执掌阴晴雨雪诸事务。人", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1187, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "心，对人的言行进行监督和裁决，给以相应的报偿和惩罚。并执掌阴晴雨雪诸事务。人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1187, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 17, "text": "们遇险或不公平时，常呼 Bian'", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1243, "w": 532, "h": 66}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "们遇险或不公平时，常呼 Bian'", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1243, "w": 532, "h": 66}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 18, "text": "yu’！（天呐！）若久旱不雨或久雨不晴，也可对天进行责", "bbox_px": {"x": 611, "y": 1242, "w": 1022, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "yu’！（天呐！）若久旱不雨或久雨不晴，也可对天进行责", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 611, "y": 1242, "w": 1022, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 19, "text": "骂。对天神没有固定的祭祀时间和地点，只有在求雨等仪式中，包含了对神祈祷的内容。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1316, "w": 1528, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "骂。对天神没有固定的祭祀时间和地点，只有在求雨等仪式中，包含了对神祈祷的内容。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1316, "w": 1528, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 20, "text": "2. 雷神（turpja”）", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1371, "w": 310, "h": 59}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "2. 雷神（turpja”）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1371, "w": 310, "h": 59}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 21, "text": "在祧祭（ku'ta:u’）仪式上，供奉的雷神偶像是身肥体胖，满脸横肉，手执令牌，一幅区", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1440, "w": 1455, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "在祧祭（ku'ta:u’）仪式上，供奉的雷神偶像是身肥体胖，满脸横肉，手执令牌，一幅区", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1440, "w": 1455, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 22, "text": "相。摩教认为，雷神司雨，并监督人类行为中是否有打骂父母和长辈，以及浪费粮食等情", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1509, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "相。摩教认为，雷神司雨，并监督人类行为中是否有打骂父母和长辈，以及浪费粮食等情", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1509, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 23, "text": "况，若有，则将其劈死。父母常以此教育孩子孝敬父母，尊重长辈，爱惜粮食。为不使雷", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1573, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "况，若有，则将其劈死。父母常以此教育孩子孝敬父母，尊重长辈，爱惜粮食。为不使雷", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1573, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 24, "text": "神误伤无辜，布依人家大年三十夜和新年正月初一，分别做成一个大粑粑，称“好习乜”", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1633, "w": 1520, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神误伤无辜，布依人家大年三十夜和新年正月初一，分别做成一个大粑粑，称“好习乜”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1633, "w": 1520, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 25, "text": "用来“当岜”（ta:n'pja’），即遮挡“雷神”。雷神是个欺软怕硬的角色，据说雷鸣时，朝天打", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1698, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "用来“当岜”（ta:n'pja’），即遮挡“雷神”。雷神是个欺软怕硬的角色，据说雷鸣时，朝天打", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1698, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 26, "text": "枪，并烧一点头发和牛角，就能息雷霆，吓跑雷神。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1770, "w": 864, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "枪，并烧一点头发和牛角，就能息雷霆，吓跑雷神。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1770, "w": 864, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 27, "text": "3. 山神（gu*po'）", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1826, "w": 306, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "3. 山神（gu*po'）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1826, "w": 306, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 28, "text": "有些山被认为住着山神，若到那里打猎，须先在山下燃香烧纸拜过，人山才能打着猎", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1899, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有些山被认为住着山神，若到那里打猎，须先在山下燃香烧纸拜过，人山才能打着猎", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1899, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 29, "text": "物。因为猎物是山神养着的。有些山不知是否住着山神，如果出猎多次未打到猎物，也", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1963, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "物。因为猎物是山神养着的。有些山不知是否住着山神，如果出猎多次未打到猎物，也", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1963, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 30, "text": "认为有山神住着，再次出猎时，也要点香烧纸拜山神。这明显是自然崇拜。很多村寨都", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2028, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "认为有山神住着，再次出猎时，也要点香烧纸拜山神。这明显是自然崇拜。很多村寨都", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2028, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 31, "text": "修有山神庙或山王庙，每年于固定的日子全村集体祭祀。例如贞丰一带有的村寨于农历", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2092, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "修有山神庙或山王庙，每年于固定的日子全村集体祭祀。例如贞丰一带有的村寨于农历", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2092, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 138, "line_no": 32, "text": "三月十五日由布摩率寨老和全体男性村民祭祀山王爷，祈求山神保佑全村风调雨顺、六", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2156, "w": 1536, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三月十五日由布摩率寨老和全体男性村民祭祀山王爷，祈求山神保佑全村风调雨顺、六", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2156, "w": 1536, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
